<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="ffcc8a277-ebb3-44fe-b868-1d2f00a13408">For the Surgical Aesthetics segment, all other expenses includes salaries and related costs, research and development, professional services, including marketing and physician consulting, and other selling, general, and administrative expenses such as travel and entertainment, advertising, trade show fees and meeting and training costs. For the OEM segment, substantially all related expenses are recorded as cost of sales, therefore no significant segment specific operating expenses are incurred. For Corporate &amp; Other, all other expenses includes salaries and related costs, professional services, including legal, accounting and audit fees, investor relations consulting, information technology consulting, board of directors&#8217; stock compensation expense, and general and administrative expenses, such as insurance, building lease costs, depreciation and computer software.</ix:footnote></ix:hidden>
