   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, principal repayments on the debt are as follows:</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfMaturitiesOfLongTermDebtTableTextBlock" id="c3245217" escape="true">
