   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">During <em style="font: inherit;"> November 2024, </em>the Company sold pre-funded warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction id="c148772202" contextRef="i_2024-11-30_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-PrefundedWarrantsMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">2,934,690</ix:nonFraction> shares of its Common Stock, of which <ix:nonFraction id="c148772203" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-PrefundedWarrantsMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,923,623</ix:nonFraction> remain outstanding and unexercised at <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026. </em>Unexercised&#160;pre-funded warrants are included in weighted average shares outstanding in the calculation of basic and diluted loss per share.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
