   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">(i) For the Surgical Aesthetics segment, all other expenses includes&#160;salaries and related costs, research and development, professional services, including marketing and physician consulting, and other&#160;selling, general, and administrative expenses such as travel and entertainment, advertising, trade show fees and&#160;meeting and training costs. For the OEM segment, substantially all related expenses are recorded as cost of sales, therefore&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">no</em>&#160;significant segment specific operating expenses are incurred.&#160;For&#160;Corporate &amp; Other, all other expenses&#160;includes salaries and related costs, professional services, including legal, accounting and audit fees, investor relations consulting,&#160;information technology consulting,&#160;board of directors&#8217; stock compensation expense, and general and administrative expenses, such as insurance, building lease costs, depreciation and computer software.</p>
   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
