   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">International sales represented approximately <ix:nonFraction id="c148772372" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-GeographicConcentrationRiskMember_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">32.2</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction id="c148772373" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-GeographicConcentrationRiskMember_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">33.6</ix:nonFraction>% of total revenues for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, respectively, as compared with approximately <ix:nonFraction id="c148772376" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-GeographicConcentrationRiskMember_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">31.6</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction id="c148772377" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-GeographicConcentrationRiskMember_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">30.2</ix:nonFraction>% of total revenues for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2025, </em>respectively.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Sales by geographic region, based on the customer's &#8220;ship to&#8221; location on the invoice, are as follows:</p>
